  "dct_description_sm": [
    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us7000t2w3](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us7000t2w3) Magnitude 5.8 earthquake at 49.188 depth occurred on Jul 23 2026 130 km W of Ternate, Indonesia. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude 0.592 longitude 126.2244. It impacted 329 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
